{"id":"u58","kelas":"kerja","no":11,"judul":"Pemecahan Masalah dan Laporan Status","title":"Problem Solving and Status Updates","emoji":"🛠️","ringkas":"Melaporkan masalah, progres, kendala, dan langkah berikutnya","ready":true,"goals":["melaporkan **masalah** dengan jelas: apa yang terjadi, kapan, dan dampaknya","menyampaikan **status** pekerjaan: [[I've finished ...]], [[I'm working on ...]], [[I'll start ... tomorrow]]","memakai present perfect, present continuous, dan future untuk laporan status","menjelaskan **penyebab**, **solusi sementara** (workaround), dan perkiraan selesai (ETA)","meminta bantuan dan menyampaikan kendala (blocker) dengan sopan","memberi **update harian** singkat (stand-up) secara terstruktur"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Di tempat kerja, kamu sering perlu menjawab: *Ada masalah apa? Sudah sampai mana? Kapan selesai?* Laporan yang jelas membuat tim cepat mengambil keputusan. Contoh di unit ini bersifat umum dan cocok untuk tim mana pun, termasuk tim teknis."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Melaporkan masalah","table":[["Bagian","Ungkapan","Contoh"],["Menyebut masalah","[[We have a problem with ...]] / [[There's an issue with ...]]","[[There's an issue with the payment system.]]"],["Gejala","[[It doesn't work.]] / [[It keeps crashing.]] / [[It's running slowly.]]","[[The website keeps crashing.]]"],["Waktu mulai","[[It started at ...]] / [[It has been happening since ...]]","[[It has been happening since 9 a.m.]]"],["Dampak","[[This affects ...]] / [[As a result, customers can't ...]]","[[This affects all online orders.]]"],["Tingkat urgensi","[[It's urgent.]] / [[It's not critical, but ...]]","[[It's urgent because ...]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Menyampaikan status","table":[["Status","Tense","Contoh"],["**Sudah selesai**","present perfect / past","[[I've finished the report.]] / [[We fixed the bug yesterday.]]"],["**Sedang dikerjakan**","present continuous","[[I'm working on the invoice.]]"],["**Sedang berjalan sejak tadi**","present perfect continuous","[[I've been testing it since morning.]]"],["**Akan dikerjakan**","will / going to","[[I'll send it by 5 p.m.]] / [[We're going to restart the server.]]"],["**Terhambat**","be blocked by","[[I'm blocked by the missing data.]]"],["**Selesai (pasif)**","has been + V3","[[The issue has been resolved.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Present perfect vs simple past","text":"Present perfect fokus pada **hasil sekarang**: [[I've fixed it. It works now.]] Simple past dipakai bila ada **waktu lampau yang jelas**: [[I fixed it at 9 a.m.]]"},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"issue / problem","id":"masalah","ex":"We found an issue."},{"en":"bug","id":"kesalahan program","ex":"There's a bug in the app."},{"en":"crash","id":"macet / mogok","ex":"The system crashed."},{"en":"root cause","id":"akar penyebab","ex":"We found the root cause."},{"en":"workaround","id":"solusi sementara","ex":"We have a workaround."},{"en":"fix","id":"memperbaiki / perbaikan","ex":"The fix is ready."},{"en":"resolve","id":"menyelesaikan","ex":"The issue was resolved."},{"en":"blocker","id":"penghambat","ex":"The main blocker is missing data."},{"en":"progress","id":"kemajuan","ex":"We are making progress."},{"en":"update","id":"pembaruan / kabar terbaru","ex":"Here's a quick update."},{"en":"ETA","id":"perkiraan selesai","ex":"What's the ETA?"},{"en":"priority","id":"prioritas","ex":"This is high priority."},{"en":"escalate","id":"mengeskalasi","ex":"I'll escalate it."},{"en":"in progress","id":"sedang dikerjakan","ex":"The task is in progress."},{"en":"on hold","id":"ditahan sementara","ex":"The project is on hold."},{"en":"ticket","id":"tiket / catatan masalah","ex":"I opened a ticket."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Menjelaskan penyebab dan solusi","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Penyebab","[[The problem was caused by ...]] / [[It happened because ...]] / [[The root cause is ...]]"],["Solusi sementara","[[As a workaround, we can ...]] / [[For now, please use ...]]"],["Solusi tetap","[[The permanent fix will be ready by ...]]"],["Tindakan sekarang","[[We're currently looking into it.]] / [[We're working on a fix.]]"],["Perkiraan selesai","[[We expect it to be resolved by 3 p.m.]] / [[The ETA is tomorrow morning.]]"],["Meminta bantuan","[[Could you give me a hand with ...?]] / [[I need some help with ...]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Format stand-up harian","table":[["Pertanyaan","Contoh jawaban"],["**Yesterday**: apa yang kamu kerjakan?","[[Yesterday I finished the sales report.]]"],["**Today**: apa rencanamu?","[[Today I'm going to review the budget.]]"],["**Blockers**: ada hambatan?","[[I'm waiting for data from Finance.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Melaporkan masalah","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Mr. Adi, we have a problem with the online order system. It keeps crashing.","id":"Pak Adi, kita punya masalah dengan sistem pesanan daring. Sistemnya terus mogok."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"When did it start?","id":"Kapan mulainya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"It has been happening since 9 a.m. As a result, customers can't place orders.","id":"Sudah terjadi sejak pukul 9 pagi. Akibatnya, pelanggan tidak bisa memesan."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"That's urgent. Do we know the cause?","id":"Itu mendesak. Apakah kita tahu penyebabnya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Not yet. Tom is looking into it. For now, we can take orders by phone as a workaround.","id":"Belum. Tom sedang memeriksanya. Untuk sementara, kita bisa menerima pesanan lewat telepon sebagai solusi sementara."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Update status","lines":[{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Tom, any update on the issue?","id":"Tom, ada kabar terbaru tentang masalahnya?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Yes. We've found the root cause. The server ran out of memory.","id":"Ya. Kami sudah menemukan akar penyebabnya. Memori server habis."},{"who":"Tom","en":"I've applied a temporary fix, and the system is working again. The permanent fix will be ready by tomorrow morning.","id":"Saya sudah menerapkan perbaikan sementara, dan sistem berjalan lagi. Perbaikan permanen akan siap besok pagi."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Good work. Please send me a short report by 5 p.m.","id":"Kerja bagus. Tolong kirim laporan singkat sebelum pukul 5 sore."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Will do.","id":"Siap."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 3: Stand-up pagi","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Yesterday I finished the sales report. Today I'm going to review the budget.","id":"Kemarin saya menyelesaikan laporan penjualan. Hari ini saya akan meninjau anggaran."},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm blocked by one thing: I'm still waiting for the cost data from Finance.","id":"Saya terhambat satu hal: saya masih menunggu data biaya dari Keuangan."},{"who":"Tom","en":"I can ask them for you. Could you send me the request?","id":"Saya bisa menanyakannya untukmu. Bisakah kamu kirim permintaannya?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Thank you. I really appreciate it.","id":"Terima kasih. Saya sangat menghargainya."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Laporan masalah: **apa → sejak kapan → dampak → urgensi**.","Status: [[I've finished ...]] (selesai), [[I'm working on ...]] (sedang), [[I'll send ... by ...]] (akan).","Penyebab dan solusi: [[caused by]], [[as a workaround]], [[the permanent fix]], [[ETA]].","Hambatan: [[I'm blocked by ...]]; bantuan: [[Could you give me a hand with ...?]]","Stand-up: **Yesterday → Today → Blockers**."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["workaround","solusi sementara"],["root cause","akar penyebab"],["blocker","penghambat"],["progress","kemajuan"],["on hold","ditahan sementara"]],"exp":"Kosakata masalah dan status.","k":"2c6bd5f3"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan status dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["selesai","I've finished the report."],["sedang","I'm working on the invoice."],["akan","I'll send it by 5 p.m."],["terhambat","I'm blocked by missing data."]],"exp":"Status.","k":"886584ce"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan gejala dengan ungkapan:","pairs":[["mogok","It keeps crashing."],["lambat","It's running slowly."],["tidak berfungsi","It doesn't work."],["mendesak","It's urgent."]],"exp":"Gejala.","k":"40b14984"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Urutan laporan masalah yang baik adalah...","options":["apa, sejak kapan, dampak, urgensi","salam saja","jawaban saja","dampak saja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terstruktur.","k":"a699c549"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk melaporkan masalah adalah...","options":["There's an issue with the payment system.","Payment is fun.","I like systems.","System is blue."],"answer":0,"exp":"Melaporkan.","k":"31529089"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk solusi sementara adalah...","options":["As a workaround, we can take orders by phone.","Stop working.","Forget it.","Ask nobody."],"answer":0,"exp":"Workaround.","k":"d7f7502b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk penyebab adalah...","options":["The problem was caused by a software update.","Problem is.","Cause no.","Update, update."],"answer":0,"exp":"caused by.","k":"437b5fde"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk perkiraan selesai adalah...","options":["We expect it to be resolved by 3 p.m.","It will never end.","Maybe.","I forgot."],"answer":0,"exp":"Expect.","k":"d90835f6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat present perfect yang benar adalah...","options":["The issue has been resolved.","The issue have been resolved.","The issue has been resolve.","The issue was been resolved."],"answer":0,"exp":"has been + V3.","k":"05dcc9a4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat present continuous yang benar adalah...","options":["I'm working on the report.","I work on the report now.","I worked on the report now.","I am work on the report."],"answer":0,"exp":"am + V-ing.","k":"1279fb04"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"I've been testing it since morning\" menekankan...","options":["kegiatan yang berlangsung sejak pagi","kegiatan selesai kemarin","rencana besok","pertanyaan"],"answer":0,"exp":"present perfect continuous.","k":"365d7aff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara sopan meminta bantuan adalah...","options":["Could you give me a hand with this?","Help.","You help me.","Do it for me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"dd056c11"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Dalam stand-up, bagian 'Blockers' berisi...","options":["hambatan yang dihadapi","daftar makanan","jam pulang","gaji"],"answer":0,"exp":"Blockers = hambatan.","k":"24256d31"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ada masalah dengan sistem.","q":"There's an ___ with the system.","answers":["issue","problem"],"hint":"masalah","exp":"issue.","k":"ee911043"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sistem terus mogok.","q":"The system keeps ___.","answers":["crashing"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"keeps + V-ing.","k":"21849f5b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini sudah terjadi sejak pagi.","q":"It has been happening ___ morning.","answers":["since"],"hint":"sejak","exp":"since.","k":"d5424b05"},{"type":"fill","id":"Masalah ini disebabkan oleh pembaruan.","q":"The problem was ___ by an update.","answers":["caused"],"hint":"V3","exp":"caused by.","k":"da86d988"},{"type":"fill","id":"Perbaikan permanen akan siap besok.","q":"The ___ fix will be ready tomorrow.","answers":["permanent"],"hint":"tetap","exp":"permanent.","k":"db07dbc9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya terhambat oleh data yang hilang.","q":"I'm ___ by the missing data.","answers":["blocked"],"hint":"terhambat","exp":"blocked by.","k":"7df933a9"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kami sedang memeriksa masalah itu.\"","answer":"We are looking into the problem.","exp":"look into.","k":"294a6a65"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Masalah itu telah diselesaikan.\"","answer":"The issue has been resolved.","exp":"has been + V3.","k":"ee0ce098"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The website keeps crashing","options":["Situs web terus mogok","Situs web lambat","Situs web baru","Situs web ditutup"],"answer":0,"exp":"keeps crashing.","k":"f3f1cdbc"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I have fixed the problem and it works now","options":["Saya sudah memperbaiki masalah dan sekarang berfungsi","Saya merusak masalah","Masalahnya baru","Saya tidak tahu"],"answer":0,"exp":"have fixed.","k":"6ce9242f"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"We expect it to be resolved by three p m","options":["Kami perkirakan selesai sebelum pukul 3 sore","Kami mulai pukul 3","Kami libur pukul 3","Kami lupa"],"answer":0,"exp":"expect.","k":"a33c6d2c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aplikasinya berjalan lambat.","q":"The app is running ___.","answers":["slowly"],"hint":"lambat","exp":"slowly.","k":"44476057"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ini memengaruhi semua pelanggan.","q":"This ___ all customers.","answers":["affects"],"hint":"memengaruhi","exp":"affects.","k":"72441bff"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami sedang menyelidikinya.","q":"We're currently ___ into it.","answers":["looking"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"looking into.","k":"7833d3b4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya telah menguji ini sejak pagi.","q":"I've been ___ this since morning. (test)","answers":["testing"],"hint":"V-ing","exp":"have been testing.","k":"c78a5e03"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tolong gunakan metode lama untuk sementara.","q":"For ___, please use the old method.","answers":["now"],"hint":"sekarang","exp":"for now.","k":"a802ef3c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami menunggu data dari Keuangan.","q":"We are ___ for data from Finance.","answers":["waiting"],"hint":"menunggu","exp":"waiting for.","k":"6ad95387"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah kamu membantuku?","q":"Could you give me a ___?","answers":["hand"],"hint":"tangan","exp":"give me a hand.","k":"2f979684"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan terus memberi kabar.","q":"I'll keep you ___.","answers":["posted"],"hint":"terkini","exp":"keep you posted.","k":"9d7038ff"},{"type":"fill","id":"Proyek itu ditahan sementara.","q":"The project is on ___.","answers":["hold"],"hint":"tahan","exp":"on hold.","k":"ac6ed022"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya membuka sebuah tiket.","q":"I opened a ___.","answers":["ticket"],"hint":"tiket","exp":"ticket.","k":"ed4372d9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Server sudah dimulai ulang.","q":"The server has been ___. (restart)","answers":["restarted"],"hint":"V3","exp":"restarted.","k":"93680014"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang melaporkan gejala?","options":["The page doesn't load.","The page is blue.","The page is nice.","The page was written."],"answer":0,"exp":"Gejala.","k":"8872372d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan penyebab?","options":["It happened because the server ran out of memory.","It is Monday.","Server is.","Memory memory."],"answer":0,"exp":"because.","k":"fb5d7b29"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan solusi tetap?","options":["The permanent fix will be ready tomorrow.","We have a headache.","Nobody knows.","It's fine."],"answer":0,"exp":"permanent fix.","k":"3014fa14"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyatakan hambatan?","options":["I'm blocked by the missing data.","I'm happy with the data.","The data is blue.","Data data."],"answer":0,"exp":"blocked.","k":"d4459fff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang sopan memberi tahu atasan?","options":["I wanted to let you know that there's an issue with the server.","Server broke, fix it.","Hey boss, bad news.","Server."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"b7c95965"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menanyakan perkiraan waktu?","options":["When do you expect it to be fixed?","Why fix?","Who fixes?","Fix?"],"answer":0,"exp":"expect.","k":"7ff81a60"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["We've found the cause.","We've find the cause.","We have found the cause yesterday.","We found have the cause."],"answer":0,"exp":"have + V3.","k":"96b19c20"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang benar?","options":["I'm going to restart the server.","I'm going restart the server.","I going to restart the server.","I'm go to restart the server."],"answer":0,"exp":"am going to + V1.","k":"a6cdd34f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"root cause\" artinya...","options":["akar penyebab","akar pohon","jalan raya","kunci utama"],"answer":0,"exp":"root cause.","k":"7065568c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"bug\" dalam IT artinya...","